  "resolution": "The q.94 a.5 reading and shared-data test assert only the need for correction. They do not assert an accomplished change or the stronger open bridge that every genuine correction replaces an untrue belief. CORRECTION_3 and CORRECTION_4 are analyst interpretation alternatives, not a conjunction or a selection of the original CORRECTION_2 mapping. The former requires identical matter; the latter requires different matter and an explicitly primitive replacement act. Original meaning and root authority applicability remain OPEN.",
